      "updated": 1795505603856,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "In NodeJS, there is no window object\nas there is no GUI to be used, we cannot \noperate query selector using the window.\n\n__dirname -> path to current directory\n__filename -> file name\nrequire -> function to use modules (CommonJS)\nmodule -> info about current module (file)\nprocess -> info about enviroment where\n    the program is executed",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "In NodeJS, there is no window object\nas there is no GUI to be used, we cannot \noperate query selector using the window.\n\n__dirname -> path to current directory\n__filename -> file name\nrequire -> function to use modules (CommonJS)\nmodule -> info about current module (file)\nprocess -> info about enviroment where\n    the program is executed",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
