      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1795507907354,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "If we have items list as:\n\nconst items = ['i1','i2']\n\nTO export we can use:\n\nmodule.exports.items = ['.......']\n\nThe same thing with:\n\nconst person = {\n    name: 'bob'\n}\n\nWe can do:\n\nmodule.exports.singlePerson = person",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "If we have items list as:\n\nconst items = ['i1','i2']\n\nTO export we can use:\n\nmodule.exports.items = ['.......']\n\nThe same thing with:\n\nconst person = {\n    name: 'bob'\n}\n\nWe can do:\n\nmodule.exports.singlePerson = person",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
