      "text": "Lets create ./7-mg.js:\n\nconst num1 = 5;\nconst num2 = 10;\n\nfunction addvalues(){\n    console.log(`the sum is : \n                ${num1 + num2}')\n}\n\naddvalues()\n\n\nWhen we require it in the app.js:\n\nrequire('./7-mg')\n\n//it automatically executes and displays",
      "fontSize": 20,
