      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "npm -> node package manager\n\nUsed to pre-install already developed packages and ensure that\nthe packages being used are safe and secure. \n\nThe ammount of weekly downloads gives a view on the security of\nthe project.\n\nIf there is a bug, most probably its resolved.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "npm -> node package manager\n\nUsed to pre-install already developed packages and ensure that\nthe packages being used are safe and secure. \n\nThe ammount of weekly downloads gives a view on the security of\nthe project.\n\nIf there is a bug, most probably its resolved.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
